00:24:01.680 --> 00:24:05.160
We had a bunch of Harry Potter fans in the writer's room.

454
00:24:05.320 --> 00:24:13.320
It even evolved to a situation where we had chopsticks hanging around the room from takeout,

455
00:24:13.500 --> 00:24:15.980
